        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 2:19PM EDT until September 28 at 8:00AM EDT by NWS Gray ME</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts up to 35 kt and
seas 3 to 6 ft.

* WHERE...Penobscot Bay and Casco Bay.

* WHEN...Until 8 AM EDT Monday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
